The SR-IOV tc-flower backend (pkg/tcflower) draws on the design and
approach of the following Apache-2.0 projects. No source was copied
verbatim; where an algorithm is reproduced it is reimplemented and cited
in the relevant source file:

  - k8snetworkplumbingwg/multi-networkpolicy-tc
    (tc-flower-on-VF-representor enforcement of MultiNetworkPolicy)
    https://github.com/k8snetworkplumbingwg/multi-networkpolicy-tc

  - Mellanox/sriovnet (VF-to-representor sysfs resolution algorithm;
    reimplemented host-prefix-aware in pkg/tcflower/discover.go)
    https://github.com/Mellanox/sriovnet
